title: Remove sp-std from asset-rewards, meta-tx, derivatives and oracle runtime API
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes the `sp-std` dependency from `pallet-asset-rewards`, `pallet-meta-tx`,
    `pallet-derivatives` and `pallet-oracle-runtime-api` in favour of `alloc`. The public API of
    these crates is unchanged.
crates:
- name: pallet-asset-rewards
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-meta-tx
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-derivatives
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-oracle-runtime-api
  bump: patch
